      "id": "claim_0b4d3eb3c60e4e3ab4c29e3eddf5a79a",
      "statement": "dashboard-api is a standalone Cloudflare Worker at apps/dashboard-api whose entrypoint src/index.ts exports a default fetch handler; it is the central read-only dashboard API that replaces direct browser Supabase reads with a single worker-held service-role key so apps/dashboard becomes a thin renderer that computes nothing locally.",
